    "physicalNotes": [
      "Seat CD4027BE pin 1 at F12. Leave outputs 1, 2 and 14 isolated. Ground SET1 and all five inputs of the unused second flip-flop.",
      "Pulse RESET high to initialize Q low, then return RESET to 0 V before clocking. Use common-return 0 V and 5 V inputs.",
      "Fit the 10 kΩ output resistor and verify any LED illumination on actual hardware."
    ],
